e. Pilote l'ingénierie, l'infrastructure et le Mac Mini qui fait tourner la pile IA de l'entreprise. Livre du code de production et veille à ce que tout reste opérationnel.",{"author":46,"role":47,"text":48},"Rhine Solution","Le studio","Deux personnes, une mission : créer des logiciels utiles. Nous prenons quelques projets et les menons à bien.",{"card1Description":50,"card1Title":51,"card2Description":52,"card2Title":53,"card3Description":54,"card3Title":55,"card4Description":56,"card4Title":57,"description":58,"title":59},"Nous prenons quelques projets et les menons à bien.","L'artisanat avant la quantité","Structure claire, CSS pur, aucune dépendance inutile.","La simplicité l'emporte","Les agents et les modèles nous font gagner du temps ; ce sont les humains qui décident.","Assisté par l'IA, mené par l'humain","Chaque décision vit dans le Brain, pas seulement dans une tête.","Documenté, toujours","Nous privilégions la simplicité, l'artisanat et le code de production. Quand nous promettons un projet, il est livré.","Ce que nous valorisons",[61,62,63],"Two people","AI-first","5+ projects shipped","Studio facts","We make custom web experiences — portfolios, portals, and products — from first sketch to live deploy. Small team, no sales layer; you talk to the builders.","Rhine Solution is a two-person studio led by a CEO/CTO pair who build together — strategy and engineering under one roof.","Le studio","We favor simplicity, craft, and production code — built in the Netherlands, shipped worldwide.","Every decision lives in the Obsidian Brain — documented and repeatable. When we promise a project, it ships.","Comment nous travaillons",{"documents":72,"paths":75,"mappings":110},[73],{"_id":74,"_type":74},"careers",[76,77,78,79,80,81,82,83,84,85,86,87,88,89,90,91,92,93,94,95,96,97,98,99,100,101,102,103,104,105,106,107,108,109],"$['footerBody']","$['footerTitle']","$['heroSubtitle']","$['heroTitle']","$['listItems']","$['metaDescription']","$['metaTitle']","$['quotes'][